OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal after woman helping horse
OL,4,Ais struck by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for witnesses
OL,7,Fafter a woman trying to restrain a
OL,8,Floose horse was struck by a car in
OL,9,FHorbury.
OL,11,FThe woman, in her 30s, was hit by a
OL,12,Fwhite Audi A6 which was overtaking a
OL,13,Fvehicle on Bridge Road sometime between
OL,14,F16:00 and 16:30 BST on 10 September,
OL,15,Faccording to West Yorkshire Police.
OL,17,FShe was left with non-life-threatening
OL,18,Finjuries after briefly being carried on
OL,19,Fthe bumper of the Audi before it was
OL,20,Fdriven away, a force spokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
