OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal after woman helping horse
OL,4,Ais struck by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 22-year-old woman was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted section 18
OL,8,Fassault in connection with the
OL,9,Fincident, and was later bailed pending
OL,10,Ffurther investigations.
